Khaak Par Lashae shabbir Hai Aao Nana<br>
kya Yehi Ajr-e-risalath Hai Batao Nana <br>
<br>
1. Bhai Be Ghusl-0-kafan Dasht-e-bala Me Hai Pada<br>
<br>
paas Mayyath Ke Udhane Ko Nahi Koi Rida<br>
<br>
ab Koi Raah Nawasi Ko Dikhao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Zulm Beemaar Pa Dhaane Ke Liye Aaye Hai<br>
<br>
ashqiya Tauq Pinhane Ke Liye Aaye Hai<br>
<br>
ghash Ke Aalam Me Hai Sajjad Bachao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Koi Hamdard Nahi Koi Sahara Bhi Nahi<br>
<br>
dashte Zulmath Me Koi Poochne Wala Bhi Nahi<br>
<br>
ab Ghareeboun Pe Taras Aap Hi Khao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Thak Ke Soye Hain Badi Der Me Pyase Bache<br>
<br>
dashte Tareek Me Ab Koun Hai Jo Pehra De<br>
<br>
mere Ghazi Mere Abbas Ko Lao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Aap Ke Laal Pa Tooti Hai Qayamath Dekho<br>
<br>
qatl Ke Baad Bhi Ummat Ki Adawat Dekho<br>
<br>
laash Pamaali Ki Zad Par Hai Bachao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Baap Ko Ro Nahi Sakti Hai Sakina Apne<br>
<br>
sehmi Sehmi Si Hai Masoom Tamache Khaake<br>
<br>
shimr Ke Zulm Se Bachi Ko Chudao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Sar Pe Kunbe Ki Hifazat Ka Hai Zimma Pehle<br>
<br>
saamna Shaam-e-ghareeba'n Ka Karungi Kaise<br>
<br>
hausla Do Meri Himmat Ko Badao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Hashr Rone Ki Sada Se Hai Andhere Bun Me<br>
<br>
seena-e-shah Se Lipti Hai Sakina Run Me<br>
<br>
baap Ki Laash Se Beti Ko Chudao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
9. Baandhne Aaye Hai Zaalim Mere Baazu Me Rasan<br>
<br>
kab Se Awaaz Lagati Hai Musibat Me Behen<br>
<br>
bhai Soya Lab-e-darya Hai Jagaao Nana<br>
<br>
<br>
10. Bain Sadiq Ye Behen Ke The Larazti Thi Zamee'n<br>
<br>
rone Wala Mere Bhai Pa Yahan Koi Nahi<br>
<br>
aao Ab Farsh-e-aza Aake Bichao Nana.